  "question": {
    "text": "Consider three square matrices <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>B</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math> of order <math><mn>3</mn></math> such that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>A</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>B</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>B</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>C</mi></math>, then the incorrect option is"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>C</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>A</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>B</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mi>T</mi></msup></math>&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>B</mi></math> is a skew symmetric matrix of order <math><mn>3</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>B</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>C</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>B</mi><mi>T</mi></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>C</mi></math> is a skew symmetric matrix of order <math><mn>3</mn><mi></mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />Taking transpose of first equation<br /><math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow></msup><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow></msup></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>B</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>B</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>C</mi></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>C</mi></math></p>"
  }
